msgid "## ScummVM at a Glance\n\nScummVM is a modern reimplementation of various game engines. Once you transfer the original game data to your device, it endeavors to use it to faithfully recreate the original gaming experience. \n\nScummVM isn't your typical emulator of DOS, Windows, or some console. Rather than a one-size-fits-all approach, it takes a meticulous route, implementing the precise game logic for each specific title or engine it supports. ScummVM will not work with game engines it does not support.\n\nScummVM is developed by a team of volunteers and is free software. We lack an extensive testing team, possess only a limited range of devices, and cannot always address every request. We also do not run advertisements or sell you anything. Please be mindful of this when you submit a complaint or a bug report.\n\n## Where to get the games\n\nVisit [our Wiki](https://wiki.scummvm.org/index.php?title=Where_to_get_the_games) for a detailed list of supported games and where to purchase them.\n\nAlternatively, you can download a variety of [freeware games](https://scummvm.org/games) and [demos](https://www.scummvm.org/demos/) directly from our website.\n\nThe ScummVM team does not endorse any specific game supplier. However, the project receives a commission from every purchase made on [ZOOM-Platform](https://www.zoom-platform.com/?affiliate=c049516c-9c4c-42d6-8649-92ed870e8b53) through affiliate referral links.\n\nAdditionally, games not available on ZOOM-Platform can be found on other suppliers such as GOG.com and Steam.\n\nFor other (out-of-print) games, consider checking platforms like Amazon, eBay, Game Trading Zone, or other auction sites. Be cautious of faulty games and illegal game copies.\n"
msgstr "## ScummVM 概覽\n\nScummVM 是對多種遊戲引擎的現代重新實現。在你將原始遊戲資料移動到你的裝置上後，它就會努力利用這些資料忠實再現原作體驗。\n\nScummVM 並非典型的 DOS、Windows 或主機模擬器。它沒有采用千篇一律的方法，而是採取了一絲不苟的路線，為其支援的每個特定遊戲或引擎精準實現遊戲邏輯。ScummVM 不會使用不支援的遊戲引擎。\n\nScummVM 是由一個志願者團隊開發的免費軟體。我們缺乏龐大的測試團隊，僅擁有有限的裝置，因此無法滿足所有要求。我們也不做廣告或向您出售任何東西。請在提交投訴或錯誤報告時注意這一點。\n\n## 如何獲取遊戲\n\n訪問[我們的 Wiki](https://wiki.scummvm.org/index.php?title=Where_to_get_the_games)檢視所有支援的遊戲列表與購買方式。\n\n此外，你也可以直接從我們的網站下載多種[免費遊戲](https://scummvm.org/games)與[演示遊戲](https://www.scummvm.org/demos/)。\n\nScummVM 團隊不支援任何特定遊戲供應商。不過，本專案會透過 [ZOOM-Platform](https://www.zoom-platform.com/?affiliate=c049516c-9c4c-42d6-8649-92ed870e8b53) 的聯盟連結，從每筆交易中收取佣金。\n\n此外，ZOOM-Platform 上沒有的遊戲也可以在其他供應商（如 GOG.com 和 Steam）上找到。\n\n對於其他（絕版）遊戲，可考慮在 Amazon、eBay、Game Trading Zone 等平臺或其他拍賣網站上搜尋。請小心有問題的遊戲和非法遊戲複製（盜版）。\n"

#: gui/helpdialog.cpp:68 gui/options.cpp:2379
msgid "Cloud"
msgstr "雲"

#: gui/helpdialog.cpp:71
msgid "## Connecting a cloud service - Quick mode\n\n1. From the Launcher, select **Global Options** and then select the **Cloud** tab.\n\n2. Select your preferred cloud storage service from the **Active storage** dropdown, then select **Connect**.\n\n\t  ![Select cloud service](choose_storage.png \"Select cloud service\"){w=70%,maxw=50em}\n\n3. Select **Quick mode**.\n\n\t  ![Quick mode](quick_mode.png \"Quick mode\"){w=70%,maxw=50em}\n\n4. Select **Run server** and then select **Next** \n\n\t  ![Run server](run_server.png \"Run server\"){w=70%,maxw=50em}\n\n  ![Next step](server_next.png \"Next step\"){w=70%,maxw=50em}\n\n5. Open the link.\n\n\t  ![Open the link](open_link.png \"Open the link\"){w=70%,maxw=50em}\n\n6. In the browser window that opens, select the cloud service to connect. \n\n\t  ![Choose the cloud service](cloud_browser.png \"Choose the cloud service\"){w=70%,maxw=50em}\n\n7. Sign in to the chosen cloud service. Once completed, return to ScummVM.\n\n8. On the success screen, select **Finish** to exit. \n\n\t  ![Success](cloud_success.png \"Success\"){w=70%,maxw=50em}\n9. Back on the main Cloud tab, select **Enable storage**.\n\n\t  ![Enable storage](enable_storage.png \"Enable storage\"){w=70%,maxw=50em}\n\n10. You're ready to go! Use the cloud functionality to sync saved games or game files between your devices.\n\n\t  ![Cloud functionality](cloud_functions.png \"Cloud functionality\"){w=70%,maxw=50em}\n\n   For more information, including how to use the manual connection wizard, see our [Cloud documentation](https://docs.scummvm.org/en/latest/use_scummvm/connect_cloud.html) "
msgstr "## 連線雲服務 - 快速模式\n\n1. 點選啟動器中的 **全域設定**，然後轉到 **雲** 標籤頁。\n\n2. 從 **活動儲存** 中選擇偏好的雲端儲存服務，然後點選 **連線**。\n\n\t  ![選擇雲服務](choose_storage.png \"選擇雲服務\"){w=70%}\n\n3. 點選 **快速模式**。\n\n\t  ![快速模式](quick_mode.png \"快速模式\"){w=70%}\n\n4. 點選 **執行伺服器**，然後點選 **下一步**\n\n\t  ![執行伺服器](run_server.png \"執行伺服器\"){w=70%}\n\n  ![下一步](server_next.png \"下一步\"){w=70%}\n\n5. 開啟連結。\n\n\t  ![開啟連結](open_link.png \"開啟連結\"){w=70%}\n\n6. 在開啟的瀏覽器視窗中選擇要連線的雲服務。\n\n\t  ![選擇雲服務](cloud_browser.png \"選擇雲服務\"){w=70%}\n\n7. 登入所選雲服務，完成後返回 ScummVM。\n\n8. 在結束螢幕點選 **結束** 離開。\n\n\t  ![成功](cloud_success.png \"成功\"){w=70%}\n9. 回到“雲”標籤頁，點選 **啟用儲存**。\n\n\t  ![啟用儲存](enable_storage.png \"啟用儲存\"){w=70%}\n\n10. 準備就緒！你可以使用雲功能在裝置間同步存檔與遊戲資料了。\n\n\t  ![雲功能](cloud_functions.png \"雲功能\"){w=70%}\n\n   要獲取更多資訊（包括手動連線嚮導的使用方法），請檢視我們的[雲服務文件](https://docs.scummvm.org/en/latest/use_scummvm/connect_cloud.html) "

