#: backends/platform/ios7/ios7_osys_misc.mm:249
msgid "## Help, I'm lost!\n\nFirst, make sure you have the games and necessary game files ready. Check the **Where to Get the Games** section under the **General** tab. Once obtained, follow the steps outlined in the **Adding Games** tab to finish adding them on this device.\n\nNeed more help? Refer to our [online documentation for iOS](https://docs.scummvm.org/en/latest/other_platforms/ios.html). Got questions? Swing by our [support forums](https://forums.scummvm.org/viewforum.php?f=15) or hop on our [Discord server](https://discord.gg/4cDsMNtcpG), which includes an [iOS support channel](https://discord.com/channels/581224060529148060/1149456560922316911).\n\nOh, and heads up, many of our supported games are intentionally tricky, sometimes mind-bogglingly so. If you're stuck in a game, think about checking out a game walkthrough. Good luck!\n"
msgstr "## 拜託，我不知道該怎麼辦！\n\n首先，確保你已準備好遊戲和必要的遊戲檔案。檢視**常規**標籤頁下的**從何處獲取遊戲**部分。獲得遊戲後，請按照**新增遊戲**選項卡中的步驟完成在此裝置上新增遊戲。\n\n需要更多幫助？請參閱我們的 [iOS 線上文件](https://docs.scummvm.org/en/latest/other_platforms/ios.html)。有問題？請訪問我們的[支援論壇](https://forums.scummvm.org/viewforum.php?f=15)或 [Discord 伺服器](https://discord.gg/4cDsMNtcpG)，其中包括 [Android 支援頻道](https://discord.com/channels/581224060529148060/1149456560922316911)。\n\n哦，還有，請注意，許多我們支援的遊戲都有故意設定的難題，有時甚至令人匪夷所思。如果你在遊戲中卡住了，請考慮檢視遊戲攻略。祝你好運！\n"

#: backends/platform/ios7/ios7_osys_misc.mm:261
msgid "## Touch control modes\nThe touch control mode can be changed by tapping or clicking on the controller icon in the upper right corner, by swiping two fingers from left to right, or in the global settings from the Launcher go to **Global Options > Backend > Choose the preferred touch mode**. It's possible to configure the touch mode for three situations (ScummVM menus, 2D games and 3D games).\n\n### Direct mouse \n\nThe touch controls are direct. The pointer jumps to where the finger touches the screen (default for menus).\n\n  ![Direct mouse mode](mouse.png \"Direct mouse mode\"){w=10em}\n\n### Touchpad emulation \n\nThe touch controls are indirect, like on a laptop touchpad.\n\n  ![Touchpad mode](touchpad.png \"Touchpad mode\"){w=10em}\n\nTo select the preferred touch mode for menus, 2D games, and 3D games, go to **Global Options > Backend > Choose the preferred touch mode**.\n\n## Touch actions \n\n| Gesture           | Action            \n| ------------------|-------------------\n| `One finger tap`  | Left mouse click  \n| `Two fingers tap` | Right mouse click \n| `Two fingers double tap` | ESC \n| `One finger press & hold for >0.5s` | Left mouse button hold and drag, such as for selection from action wheel in Curse of Monkey Island \n| `Two fingers press & hold for >0.5s` | Right mouse button hold and drag, such as for selection from action wheel in Tony Tough \n| `Two fingers swipe (left to right)` | Toggles between the touch modes \n| `Two fingers swipe (right to left)` | Toggles virtual controller (>iOS 15) \n| `Two fingers swipe (top to bottom)` | Access Global Main Menu in games \n| `Pinch (zoom in/out)` | Enables/disables keyboard \n\n### Virtual Gamepad \n\nDevices running iOS 15 or later can connect virtual gamepad controller by swiping two fingers from right to left or through **Global Options > Backend**. The directional button can be configured to either a thumbstick or a dpad.\n**Note** While the virtual controller is connected it is not possible to perform mouse clicks using tap gestures since they are disabled as long as the virtual controller is visible. Left mouse clicks are performed by pressing the A button. Tap gestures are enabled again when virtual controller is disconnected.\n\n### Global Main Menu\n\nTo open the Global Main Menu, tap on the menu icon at the top right of the screen or swipe two fingers downwards.\n\n  ![Menu icon](menu.png \"Menu icon\"){w=10em}\n\n## Virtual keyboard\n\nTo open the virtual keyboard, long press on the controller icon at the top right of the screen, perform a pinch gesture (zoom out) or tap on any editable text field. To hide the virtual keyboard, tap the controller icon again, do an opposite pinch gesture (zoom in) or tap outside the text field.\n\n\n  ![Keyboard icon](keyboard.png \"Keyboard icon\"){w=10em}\n\n"
msgstr "## 觸控控制模式\n透過輕點或點選右上角的控制器圖示、用兩根手指從左向右輕掃，或在啟動器的全域設定中進入**全域設定 > 後端 > 選擇偏好觸控模式**，即可更改觸控控制模式。可以在三種情況下（ScummVM 選單、2D 遊戲和 3D 遊戲）配置觸控模式。\n\n### 直接滑鼠\n\n觸控控制是直接的。游標會跳到手指觸碰螢幕的地方（選單預設使用）。 \n\n  ![直接滑鼠模式](mouse.png \"直接滑鼠模式\"){w=10em}\n\n### 觸控板模擬 \n\n觸控控制是間接的，類似於使用筆記本觸控板。 \n\n  ![觸控板模式](touchpad.png \"觸控板模式\"){w=10em}\n\n轉到**全域設定 > 後端 > 選擇偏好觸控模式**以選擇選單、2D 和 3D 遊戲的偏好觸控模式。\n\n## 觸控操作 \n\n| 手勢           | 操作            \n| ------------------|-------------------\n| `單指點選`  | 滑鼠左鍵點選  \n| `雙指點選` | 滑鼠右鍵點選 \n| `雙指雙擊` | ESC \n| `單指長按 >0.5s` | 滑鼠左鍵拖放（如 Curse of Monkey Island 中從操作滾輪選擇） \n| `雙指長按 >0.5s` | 滑鼠右鍵拖放（如 Tony Tough 中從操作滾輪選擇） \n| `雙指滑動（從左向右）` | 切換觸控模式 \n| `雙指滑動（從右向左）` | 開關虛擬控制器 (>iOS 15) \n| `雙指滑動（從上向下）` | 遊戲內訪問全域主選單 \n| `縮放（縮小/放大）` | 啟用/禁用鍵盤 \n\n### 虛擬手柄  \n\n執行 iOS 15 或更高版本的裝置可透過兩根手指從右向左滑動或透過**全域設定 > 後端**連線虛擬遊戲手柄控制器。方向鍵可配置為拇指杆或手柄。\n**注意** 在連線虛擬控制器時，無法使用點選手勢執行滑鼠點選，因為只要虛擬控制器可見，點選手勢就會被禁用。滑鼠左鍵點選可透過按 A 鍵來執行。斷開虛擬控制器連線後，點選手勢將重新啟用。\n\n### 全域主選單 \n\n點選螢幕右上角的選單圖示或用兩根手指向下滑動可開啟全域主選單。\n\n  ![選單圖示](menu.png \"選單圖示\"){w=10em}\n\n## 虛擬鍵盤\n\n長按螢幕右上角的控制器圖示、雙指向外移動（放大手勢）或點選可編輯的文字框可開啟虛擬鍵盤。再次點選控制器圖示、反向移動（縮小手勢）或點選文字框外部以關閉鍵盤。\n\n\n  ![鍵盤圖示](keyboard.png \"鍵盤圖示\"){w=10em}\n\n"

#: backends/platform/ios7/ios7_osys_misc.mm:311
msgid "External keyboard"
msgstr "外部鍵盤"

#: backends/platform/ios7/ios7_osys_misc.mm:314
msgid "## Use of keyboard\nExternal keyboards are supported and from iOS 13.4 most of the special keys, e.g. function keys, Home and End, are mapped. \nFor external keyboards missing the special keys, e.g. the Apple Magic Keyboard for iPads, the special keys can be triggered using the following key combinations: \n\n\n| Key combination   | Action            \n| ------------------|-------------------\n| `CMD + 1`         | F1                \n| `CMD + 2`         | F2                \n| `...`             | ...               \n| `CMD + 0`         | F10               \n| `CMD + SHIFT + 1` | F11               \n| `CMD + SHIFT + 2` | F12               \n| `CMD + UP`        | PAGE UP           \n| `CMD + DOWN`      | PAGE DOWN         \n| `CMD + LEFT`      | HOME              \n| `CMD + RIGHT`     | END               \n\n"
msgstr "## 使用鍵盤\nScummVM 支援外接鍵盤，從 iOS 13.4 起，我們已經支援大多數特殊按鍵，例如功能鍵、Home、End 鍵。 \n對於缺少特殊按鍵的外接鍵盤（如 iPad 使用的 Apple Magic 鍵盤），可以使用以下按鍵組合觸發： \n\n\n| 按鍵組合   | 操作            \n| ------------------|-------------------\n| `CMD + 1`         | F1                \n| `CMD + 2`         | F2                \n| `...`             | ...               \n| `CMD + 0`         | F10               \n| `CMD + SHIFT + 1` | F11               \n| `CMD + SHIFT + 2` | F12               \n| `CMD + UP`        | 上一頁           \n| `CMD + DOWN`      | 下一頁         \n| `CMD + LEFT`      | HOME              \n| `CMD + RIGHT`     | END               \n\n"

#: backends/platform/ios7/ios7_osys_misc.mm:336
msgid "## Adding Games \n\n1. Copy the required game files to the ScummVM application. There are several ways to do that, see our [Transferring game files documentation](https://docs.scummvm.org/en/latest/other_platforms/ios.html#transferring-game-files) for more information.\n\n2. Select **Add Game...** from the launcher. \n\n3. In the ScummVM file browser, double-tap to browse to your added folder. Add a game by selecting the sub-folder containing the game files, then tap **Choose**. \n\nTo add more games, repeat the steps above. \n\nSee our [iOS documentation](https://docs.scummvm.org/en/latest/other_platforms/ios.html) for more information.\n"
msgstr "## 新增遊戲 \n\n1. 將所需遊戲檔案複製到 ScummVM 應用中。有多種方式可以做到，詳見[轉移遊戲檔案文件](https://docs.scummvm.org/en/latest/other_platforms/ios.html#transferring-game-files)。\n\n3. 點選啟動器中的**新增遊戲...**。\n\n3. 在 ScummVM 檔案瀏覽器中，雙擊轉到新增的資料夾，選擇含有遊戲檔案的子資料夾，然後點選**選擇**。 \n\n重複上述步驟以新增更多遊戲。\n\n瀏覽我們的 [iOS 文件](https://docs.scummvm.org/en/latest/other_platforms/ios.html)獲取更多資訊。\n"

#: backends/platform/ios7/ios7_osys_misc.mm:357
msgid "## Touch actions \n\n### Press Touch area \n\nPress Touch area to perform a left mouse click\n### Play/Pause\n\nPress Play/Pause to perform a right mouse click\n\n### Global Main Menu\n\nTo open the Global Main Menu, press Back/Menu button.\n\n## Virtual keyboard\n\nTo open the virtual keyboard, press and hold the Play/Pause button. To hide the virtual keyboard, press the Back/Menu button.\n\n"
msgstr "## 觸控操作 \n\n### 點按觸控區域 \n\n點按觸控區域可模擬滑鼠左鍵點選\n### 開始/暫停\n\n點按開始/暫停按鈕可模擬滑鼠右鍵點選\n\n### 全域主選單\n\n點按返回/選單按鈕可開啟全域主選單。\n\n## 虛擬鍵盤\n\n按住開始/暫停按鈕可開啟虛擬鍵盤，點按返回/選單按鈕可將其隱藏。\n\n"

#: backends/platform/ios7/ios7_osys_misc.mm:380
msgid "## Adding Games \n\n1. Copy the required game files to the ScummVM application. There are several ways to do that, see our [Transferring game files documentation](https://docs.scummvm.org/en/latest/other_platforms/tvos.html#transferring-game-files) for more information.\n\n2. Select **Add Game...** from the launcher. \n\n3. In the ScummVM file browser, double-tap to browse to your added folder. Add a game by selecting the sub-folder containing the game files, then tap **Choose**. \n\nTo add more games, repeat the steps above. \n\nSee our [tvOS documentation](https://docs.scummvm.org/en/latest/other_platforms/tvos.html) for more information.\n"
msgstr "## 新增遊戲 \n\n1. 將所需遊戲檔案複製到 ScummVM 應用中。有多種方式可以做到，詳見[轉移遊戲檔案文件](https://docs.scummvm.org/en/latest/other_platforms/tvos.html#transferring-game-files)。\n\n3. 點選啟動器中的**新增遊戲...**。\n\n3. 在 ScummVM 檔案瀏覽器中，雙擊轉到新增的資料夾，選擇含有遊戲檔案的子資料夾，然後點選**選擇**。 \n\n重複上述步驟以新增更多遊戲。\n\n瀏覽我們的 [tvOS 文件](https://docs.scummvm.org/en/latest/other_platforms/tvos.html)獲取更多資訊。\n"

