#: engines/sci/sci.cpp:415
msgid "Subtitles are enabled, but subtitling in King's Quest 7 was unfinished and disabled in the release version of the game. ScummVM allows the subtitles to be re-enabled, but because they were removed from the original game, they do not always render properly or reflect the actual game speech. This is not a ScummVM bug -- it is a problem with the game's assets."
msgstr "字幕已啟用，但 King's Quest 7 中的字幕未完成，在遊戲釋出版本中被禁用。ScummVM 允許重新啟用字幕，但因為其在原遊戲中被移除，字幕不總是渲染正確或反映遊戲實際語音。這不是 ScummVM 的問題 -- 是遊戲資源的問題。"

#: engines/sci/sci.cpp:439
msgid "You have selected General MIDI as a sound device. Sierra has provided after-market support for General MIDI for this game in their \"General MIDI Utility\". Please, apply this patch in order to enjoy MIDI music with this game. Once you have obtained it, you can unpack all of the included *.PAT files in your ScummVM extras folder and ScummVM will add the appropriate patch automatically. Alternatively, you can follow the instructions in the READ.ME file included in the patch and rename the associated *.PAT file to 4.PAT and place it in the game folder. Without this patch, General MIDI music for this game will sound badly distorted."
msgstr "你選擇了通用 MIDI 作為聲音裝置。Sierra 在其“通用 MIDI 實用程式”中為本遊戲提供了通用 MIDI 後市場支援。請使用此補丁，以便在遊戲中享受 MIDI 音樂。獲得該補丁後，你可以解壓縮 ScummVM 附加內容資料夾中的所有 *.PAT 檔案，ScummVM 會自動新增相應補丁。你也可以按照補丁中包含的 READ.ME 檔案中的說明，將相關 *.PAT 檔案重新命名為 4.PAT 並將其放入遊戲資料夾中。如果沒有這個補丁，這款遊戲的通用 MIDI 音樂聽起來會嚴重失真。"

#: engines/sci/sci.cpp:938
msgid "Characters saved inside ScummVM are shown automatically. Character files saved in the original interpreter need to be put inside ScummVM's saved games directory and a prefix needs to be added depending on which game it was saved in: 'qfg1-' for Quest for Glory 1, 'qfg2-' for Quest for Glory 2. Example: 'qfg2-thief.sav'."
msgstr "儲存在 ScummVM 中的角色會自動顯示。在原始直譯器中儲存的角色檔案需要放到 ScummVM 的儲存遊戲目錄中，並根據儲存的遊戲新增字首：“qfg1-”表示《光榮使命 1》，“qfg2-”表示《光榮使命 2》。例如：“qfg2-thief.sav”。"

#: engines/sci/sound/music.cpp:173
msgid "The selected audio driver requires the following file(s):\n\n"
msgstr "選中的音訊驅動需要以下檔案：\n\n"

#: engines/sci/sound/music.cpp:176
msgid "\n\nSome audio drivers (at least for some games) were made\navailable by Sierra as aftermarket patches and thus might not\nhave been installed as part of the original game setup.\n\nPlease copy these file(s) into your game data directory.\n\nHowever, please note that the file(s) might not be available\nseparately but only as content of (patched) resource bundles.\nIn that case you may need to apply the original Sierra patch.\n\n"
msgstr "\n\n一些音訊驅動（至少對某些遊戲）\n由 Sierra 作為市場後補丁釋出，\n因此可能不會作為原遊戲的一部分安裝。\n\n請將這些檔案複製到你的遊戲資料資料夾。\n\n但請注意，單獨這些檔案可能不可用，\n而是作為（補丁）資源包的內容出現。\n在這種情況下，你可能需要應用原有的 Sierra 補丁。\n\n"

#: engines/scumm/detection_internal.h:384
msgid "This version of Monkey Island can't be played, because Limited Run Games provided corrupted DISK03.LEC, DISK04.LEC and 903.LFL files.\n\nPlease contact their technical support for replacement files, or look online for some guides which can help you recover valid files from the KryoFlux dumps that Limited Run Games also provided."
msgstr "無法遊玩此版本的 Monkey Island，因為 Limited Run Games 提供了損壞的 DISK03.LEC、DISK04.LEC 與 903.LFL 檔案。\n\n請聯絡他們的技術支援替換檔案，或者在網上搜尋從他們提供的 KryoFlux 轉儲檔案中恢復有效檔案的方法。"

