#: engines/zvision/zvision.cpp:308
msgid "Before playing this game, you'll need to copy the required fonts into ScummVM's extras directory, or into the game directory. On Windows, you'll need the following font files from the Windows font directory: Times New Roman, Century Schoolbook, Garamond, Courier New and Arial. Alternatively, you can download the Liberation Fonts package. You'll need all the fonts from the font package you choose, i.e., LiberationMono, LiberationSans and LiberationSerif."
msgstr "在玩這個遊戲之前，你要先將特定的字型複製到 ScummVM 的 extras 目錄或遊戲目錄裡。在 Windows 系統中，請在 Windows 字型目錄中找到以下字型檔案：Times New Roman，Century Schoolbook，Garamond，Courier New 和 Arial。或者，你也可以下載 Liberation Fonts 或 GNU FreeFont 這兩套字型包，並二選一。你會需要用到其中任意一套中的全部字型，也就是：LiberationMono，LiberationSans 和LiberationSerif ，或者 FreeMono，FreeSans 和 FreeSerif。"

